{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027C30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Paz，你很喜欢和平手势吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。因为那是热爱和平的人们之间的暗号。Snake也试试。Say Peace。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":"AUX_SAY_PEACE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"……还是算了。这种话不适合我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"JPN_WORD_REFERENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这样啊，真可惜。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"说到底，V手势的V是<R=胜利,Victory>的V吧。它从什么时候开始有和平的意思了？","cn_control_tokens":"<R=胜利,Victory>","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我也不太清楚……好像是从反越战运动那时候开始的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对了。做和平手势时别把手背朝外。听说在英国一带，那样是在侮辱对方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_SPLIT_REJOINED_PER_JPN"}]}